{"uid":"sn1.64","title":"Fetter","reference":"Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.64","blocks":[{"kind":"verse","lines":["“What fetters the world?","How does it travel about?","With the giving up of what","is extinguishment spoken of?”","“Delight fetters the world.","It travels about by means of thought.","With the giving up of craving","extinguishment is spoken of.”"]}]}
